{
  "opening": "This release introduces significant new functionality for version manipulation and establishes a command-line interface, while also refining existing comparison behaviors. The public API must clearly expose the new replacement capabilities and CLI entry points to ensure users can interact with these features immediately upon installation.",
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "m31",
      "text": "The module must expose a top-level function named replace that accepts a version string and keyword arguments for parts, returning a new version string. Additionally, the VersionInfo class must provide an instance method named replace that accepts keyword arguments for parts and returns a new VersionInfo object with the specified fields updated."
    }
  ],
  "closing": "Please ensure all public names are accessible as described so that downstream consumers can rely on this stable contract."
}
